# Testing

Run: `npm run test` (vitest run). Single file: `npx vitest run src/lib/someFile.test.ts`.

## Sakrylle-specific tests (update when changing defaults)

- `sakrylleAuth.test.ts` — PKCE, CSRF state, refresh rotation, handleCallback, logout, OIDC
- `sakrylleAccount.test.ts` — formatBalance, fetchBalance, 401 dedupe/retry/terminal logout
- `sakrylleOidcDiscovery.test.ts` — discovery cache, fallback, issuer validation
- `oauthFallback.test.ts` — Bearer fallback conditions
- `groupSelection.test.ts` — multi-group selection, name cache, capability filter
- `sakrylleImageSize.test.ts` — Sakrylle size mapping
- `agentSentinels.test.ts` — sentinel + zh/en legacy literals
- `agentApi.test.ts` — request construction, batch call parsing
- `locales.test.ts` — zh/en key parity, placeholders

## Rule

Changing default API literals or OAuth behavior → update corresponding test assertions in the same change.
